# Keep every text file at LF in the repository regardless of the platform that
# commits it. `bin/bridge-client.mjs` starts with a shebang, and a CRLF shebang
# does not execute on POSIX systems — which would silently break the installed
# `dsh-desktop-bridge` command for macOS and Linux users.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
